WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:15.080
Hi, welcome back to our Lam Rim meditations
for our class called "Love in the Time of the Virus".

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:24.100
We've been going through the tenth chapter, 
the dedication chapter of Master Shantideva's 
Guide to the Bodhisattvas Way of Life.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:28.500
Today we're in the final week of this course,

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:33.398
and we've reached the final part of that chapter.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:38.880
It's actually verses 53 to 58. 
So, it's the very end of the chapter.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:45.780
The whole chapter is 58 verses and we're covering the last five verses now, five or six verses.

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:49.100
There are some main ideas here.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:53.440
We are still doing an act of truth. 
So, remember that!

00:00:54.320 --> 00:01:02.640
We are thinking about some amazing good karma we've done in the last month or two, in the last few months.

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:12.880
And we are grabbing on to that good seed and then we are kind of using it as a bullet to shoot the virus.

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:19.660
We are doing an act of truth. 
We're saying: if it's true that during these difficult times

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:24.849
and especially the early times 
when we were all nervous, we were all afraid. 
We didn't know what was going to happen.

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:31.980
If it's true that during those difficult times-- 
in this country we were all out of toilet paper.

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:35.880
I remember Tim gave me some. 
I bow to you. 

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:47.200
If during those very difficult times you share what you have or you're kind to someone else,

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:55.360
then you have some material, you have a bullet that you can use for your act of truth. 

00:01:55.700 --> 00:02:01.780
During this meditation, the first part, 
we're going to think about some something nice

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:05.820
we did for somebody else during the virus, 
during the difficult days, especially.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.800
And then we're going to 
take that good karma like Shantideva did--

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:15.020
his good karma was writing the book, by the way, 
the first nine chapters,

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:23.520
And then we're going to dedicate it 
that something amazing should happen. 
And then we'll have a list of amazing things.

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:32.820
Now, the amazing things are centered around this special kind of bodhisattva intention. 

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:38.560
And that's called-- it's a strange prayer.

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:46.720
Let's say you're working-- 
I used to work in a company in New York. 
We had a big company about 800 people in the building.

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.140
And, let's say I want to do a real bodhisattva thing.

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:55.220
And, by the way, I used to do this kind of thing.

00:02:55.340 --> 00:03:03.020
 I would go into the bathroom and just sit on top of the toilet and do like a five minute meditation.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:13.880
So, I would go into the bathroom, close the door, sit on top of the seat, on top of the cover.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:17.780
Then I would do this five minute meditation. 

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:28.040
This is a hard one, it's a strange one and I would think about this company, this busy, busy diamond company.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:33.120
Hundreds and hundreds of people 
in the building right now working hard. 

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:44.080
We used to work really hard and of course 
there's many problems going on: one lady has got cancer, the other lady had just lost a baby,

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:52.920
This guy is worried about losing his job, this person just had a divorce. All these kind of things in this building. 

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:58.680
We all had stress and in this building, 
eight hundred people--

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:04.060
everyone's having some kind of thing going on, 
some kind of problem going on.

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:16.000
And sitting here in the toilet stall I will suck in like a sponge, I will suck in all of their problems for five minutes, just five minutes.

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:20.280
So, this is like a dharma break you can do. 

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:29.860
I like to say that no one ever told me not to go to the toilet even during these intense board meetings with the owners and the investors.

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:36.680
It was okay to stand up and leave if you are going to go to the toilet and no one would stop you.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:43.280
So, I would use that as an excuse 
to do like five minute meditation,

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:53.580
let all the trouble in this building, let all the trouble of 800 people come into my heart, right now.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:05:01.560
All coming to me. I will eat all the little and big problems of the people that I work with.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:09.820
Just do it for five minutes. By the way, don't freak out. It's like a tong len. Of course you should destroy it

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:15.640
with the bright light at the lotus of your heart. 
Don't sit there with eight hundred people's problems.

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:18.610
Inside you're going to get sick or something.

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:28.420
Obviously you're supposed to destroy these problems, but you're supposed to be willing to take them, 
which is difficult.

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:30.380
Tong len is with one person.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:35.340
We're talking hundreds of people 
or maybe thousands of people. 

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:43.240
So, in this last meditation we're going to be doing that kind of act of truth.

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:49.580
 If it's true that during the virus I helped someone

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:59.700
then right now may all the problems of all the people in the whole universe, not just the COVID people.

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:05.980
There are billions and billions of planets like this,
all of them, I will take all of their trouble!

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:15.020
Billions and billions of planets worth of beings and not just people, all the animals, birds, insects, bacteria,

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:20.280
I would take all of them. 
Probably the COVID is running around wishing he could live also, right?

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:33.120
I would take all--
 I'll take the COVID virus' personal problems.
I will take them on myself and happily.

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:43.540
And this is an act of truth. 
If it's true that I did something nice during the virus

00:06:44.060 --> 00:06:53.760
then, by that power, should I have the power, should I have the strength to take on all the problems of billions of planets worth of people.

00:06:54.200 --> 00:07:01.740
If you want an image for it, 
we can take it from Seiji's book which is called The Crown of Knives.

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:10.780
In fact, it was an instruction granted to Lord Atisha by his teacher who is Dharma Rakshita. 

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:14.560
So, we've been talking about Lord Atisha a lot.

00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:26.020
He got a poem from his own teacher just 
before he went to this crazy country called Tibet 
to take care of the people there. 

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:28.580
The teacher said you're going to need this poem.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:33.259
Here's a poem to make you feel better when you go to all this wild Tibetans.

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:44.880
In that text they referred to a thing called 
The Crown of Knives.

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:46.880
Sometimes they call Wheel of Sharp Weapons.

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:54.000
I like Crown of Knives better 
because of an ancient story which we translated.

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:59.200
And by the way, that book is coming out soon. 
I think the translation was finished yesterday.

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:03.010
The final editing has to be done.

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:12.960
But there's a story in an ancient sutra called 
All the Kinds of karma. Karma Vibanga, 
which talks about all the correlations there are.

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:21.320
 There's a story in there of a young man who decided to take on the pain of the world.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:29.280
He was about to be murdered 
by a special ninja star wheel.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:39.400
A big one, that was about to chop into his head like a crown of knives. And just before that crown of knives came to his head, he made a prayer: 

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:44.940
May I take all the pain of all the people.
Especially my mother and my father.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:48.960
Here you see the wheel. 
We're using this wheel picture here.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.800
So, let's go! Let's start!

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:55.710
Just remember the general strategy.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:09:01.220
We're going to think 
of a good thing we did during the virus.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.860
 Then we're going to do an act of truth.

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:12.680
If it's true that I helped people during the virus, 
that I was unselfish during the virus 
then may my dreams come true.

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:18.660
What are your dreams?
My dream is that I can take all the pain of the whole Universe on me.

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:24.640
That's kind of a strange dream but I hope it works.

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:26.770
So, here we go!

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:30.749
Get ready for meditation, sit up straight.

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:33.690
I like a small smile on my face.

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:41.819
And the forehead is relaxed.

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:48.269
Just be here. 
Don't think about all the stuff you have to do.

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:54.839
We all have stuff to do and we all die in the middle of it. So, don't get too attached to it.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:59.760
Pull in your tummy.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:04.050
Shoulders back. Hands back on the thighs.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:12.920
And we'll do ten long exhales to get into the meditation.

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:40.649
So, please remember some kindness you did for somebody else during the time of the virus.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:41.300
Now we're going to do an act of truth.

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:48.500
If it's true that I paid this kindness 
to people during the virus.

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:59.340
Then, first of all, may I meet Manjushri,
may I meet that exquisite angel.

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:11.020
Beautiful, beautiful angel who is made of all the wisdom of the Buddhas, all the wisdom of all the Buddhas

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.500
May I meet Manjushri.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:25.180
If it's true that I was kind during the virus, then may I personally meet Manjushri face to face.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:53.380
And may I be like him, 
may I have this bodhisattva intention.

00:13:56.540 --> 00:14:07.060
May I have this experience of meeting all beings 
and assuring them that I will take care of them.

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:21.220
Here comes the big part of this meditation.

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:31.180
If it's true I did do some small kindness during the virus,

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:38.840
then may all the problems of all beings ripen on me.

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:42.600
 
May I take all their bad seeds into me.

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:45.980
And it feels very good. 

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:53.480
It sounds frightening, it sounds like it would be a lot of trouble and normally we are trying to escape trouble.

00:14:54.460 --> 00:15:01.480
But there's a certain beauty, extreme beauty 
to purposely and anonymously 

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:07.020
taking other people's problems away from them
and taking them on ourselves.

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:10.860
It's a little difficult to start.

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:14.460
But once you do it, it feels so right.

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:20.820
Then it becomes easy 
and it becomes extremely satisfying.

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:29.580
If it's true I did a little thing 
during the virus times for somebody else,

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:37.140
then may I have the blessing of the ability to take on other people's troubles

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:33.119
This is a big universe, this planet is not the only place there is.

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:39.620
There are countless other bodhisattvas in the universe.

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:43.340
There are many, many, countless, cannot count them.

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:48.480
Amazing wonderful people 
on many, many different planets.

00:16:51.529 --> 00:16:56.919
So, let's do an act of truth for them 
which is what master Shantideva does here.

00:16:58.340 --> 00:17:05.880
If it's true that I did a small good thing 
during the days of the virus,

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:09.600
 
if I had love during the time of the virus, 

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:23.500
then may all the dreams and all the plans
of all those bodhisattvas to help the people 
on their own planet come true.

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:30.460
May their dreams, may there plans come true.

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:34.120
By the power of my good deed.

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:10.896
These ideas are extremely unusual for someone.

00:18:10.896 --> 00:18:15.120
For all of us to sit here and pray

00:18:15.480 --> 00:18:18.040
that people's troubles should come to us,

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:26.720
it's a very, very unusual philosophy,
 unusual way of life.

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:36.580
But if it became more widespread in this world

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:40.540
 then the whole world would be much happier. 
It's much more--

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:46.600
it makes you much happier to serve other people

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:50.480
than to take things from other people.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:55.780
It makes your whole life sweet and fulfilled.

00:18:56.140 --> 00:19:03.520
If only this kind of thinking, 
strange, beautiful thinking, could spread in this world.

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:11.820
I will do an act of truth. 
If I was nice to someone during the days of the virus,

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:14.880
then this strange beautiful idea,

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:22.700
that I should take the troubles of other people, should spread in this world and make this world a happy world.

00:20:05.340 --> 00:20:11.440
In the final verse of the 
Guide to the Bodhisattva's Way of Life

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:22.420
Master Shantideva bows down 
to his own teacher, who is Manjushri, really.

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:36.780
So, we can do that together. 
Let's bow down to this divine being who is made of love,

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:38.680
bodhichitta

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:42.640
and an understanding of seeds and emptiness.

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:08.749
Okay, then slowly open your eyes.

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:12.560
Take a good stretch.

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:19.639
We'll do this meditation for the whole last week. 
Try to do it twice a day.

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:22.080
You'll be very happy.

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:27.800
And try to read that chapter or if you want to 
you can listen to the recording.

00:21:28.860 --> 00:21:33.320
And try to listen to that once or twice a day. 
See you then!

